# The prompts and the code that fills them match on "\n". Checked out with CRLF on Windows, a slot
# like "<PASTE THE PACK HERE>" stops being found — which is how v1.7.7's CI failed on Windows only
# while every Mac test passed. Keep every text file LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.xlsx binary
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.avif binary
